#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xe32903
msgid "Joined."
msgstr "已加入。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xe4d9e6
msgid "SUPPORT SUPPLY"
msgstr "支援补给"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xe6fc61
msgid "The soldier's abilities have been increased due to the experience from the mission."
msgstr "士兵因任务经验能力提升。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xe72da4
msgid "A mech has been destroyed."
msgstr "一架机甲被摧毁。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xe92645
msgid "A new weapon is now available for development!"
msgstr "新武器已可开发！"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xea2e1e
msgid "Support strikes can now be made from Mother Base. You can request powerful support strikes by using special weapons during a mission."
msgstr "现已可从母基地发动支援打击。任务中使用特殊武器即可请求强力支援打击。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xea69b8
msgid ""
"Combat operations for the dispatched unit have ended.\n"
"Unit may now be recalled from OUTER OPS."
msgstr ""
"派遣部队的战斗行动已结束。\n"
"可从外线任务中召回部队。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xf1f03c
msgid "A report has arrived from the Waiting Room."
msgstr "待命室发来报告。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xf30195
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x3e1050
msgid "OUTER OPS"
msgstr "外线"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xf83268
msgid "Recall dispatched units."
msgstr "召回派遣部队。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xfa393a
msgid "DATABASE"
msgstr "数据库"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x183317/0xfa46f5
msgid "Decommissioned due to irreparable damage suffered during battle."
msgstr "因战斗中受损无法修复而退役。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x020898
msgid "Receive gifts from other players or send gifts of your own."
msgstr "接收其他玩家的礼物，或送出你的礼物。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b7099
msgid "In OUTER OPS you can send units to conflict zones"
msgstr "外线任务中可派兵前往冲突区"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b709a
msgid "to participate in combat."
msgstr "参与战斗。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b709b
msgid "If your soldiers are victorious, they will gain experience, and you will bring in greater amounts of GMP."
msgstr "若士兵获胜，他们将获得经验，你也能获得更多GMP。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b709c
msgid "You can also obtain rewards and new recuits from the areas you help."
msgstr "你还可从协助的地区获得报酬与新兵。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b709d
msgid "However, if you are defeated, soldiers may come back injured or not come back at all. "
msgstr "但若战败，士兵可能负伤归来，甚至一去不返。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b709e
msgid "Battles will take place as you progress time by completing MAIN OPS or EXTRA OPS missions."
msgstr "战斗会随着你完成主线任务或额外任务推进时间而进行。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b709f
msgid "Mechs that sustain damage in battle"
msgstr "战斗中受损的机甲"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x0b70a0
msgid "can be repaired by temporarily removing them from the combat lineup."
msgstr "可暂时移出战斗序列进行修理。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x159033
msgid "Mother Base is divided into several teams including the Combat Unit, the R&D Team, and the Waiting Room."
msgstr "母基地分为战斗班、研发班和待命室等多个班。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x159034
msgid "By dividing your staff between the teams and raising each team's level,"
msgstr "将士兵分配到各班并提升各班等级，"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x159035
msgid "you will be able to develop new weapons and items over time."
msgstr "就能随时间开发出新武器和道具。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x159036
msgid "Select AUTO ASSIGN in the Waiting Room to automatically assign staff to teams according to their abilities."
msgstr "在待命室选择自动分配，即可按能力自动将士兵分配到各班。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x159037
msgid "Recruiting talented personnel and exploiting their talents with the right assignments is the key to expanding Mother Base."
msgstr "招募优秀人才并通过合理分配发挥其才能，是扩大母基地的关键。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x187db5
msgid "(不要)マザーベースの移動や海底の物資の引き揚げを行います。"
msgstr "(不要)负责母基地的移动和海底物资的打捞。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x26d0e7
msgid "TUTORIAL"
msgstr "教程"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x33bfbf
msgid "Adjust game settings."
msgstr "调整游戏设置。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x3bd33a
msgid "Are you sure you want to end the game and return to the title menu?"
msgstr "确定要结束游戏并返回标题菜单吗？"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x3fcec5
msgid "Metal Gear ZEKE is currently deployed on an OUTER OPS mission."
msgstr "合金装备·ZEKE目前正在执行外线任务。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x4ce674
msgid "The Intel Team carries out mission supply support and support strikes."
msgstr "情报班负责任务补给支援和支援攻击。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x4ce675
msgid "To receive support, use a Support Supply Marker or a Support Strike Marker."
msgstr "要获得支援，请使用支援补给标记或支援攻击标记。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x4ce676
msgid "The higher the level of your Intel Team, the more supplies you can transport and the more powerful the strikes you can deliver."
msgstr "情报班等级越高，可运送的补给越多，支援攻击也越强。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x4ce677
msgid "In addition, when deploying on a mission, you can also receive"
msgstr "此外，执行任务时还能获得"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x4ce678
msgid "information about the enemies and prisoners that appear in the mission."
msgstr "任务中出现的敌人和俘虏的情报。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x561ab2
msgid "View Player status."
msgstr "查看状态。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x63ba35
msgid "Mother Base is an offshore plant that supports the operations of MSF (Militaires Sans Frontières). It provides everything from staff living quarters to weapon and item R&D facilities to vehicle storage bays. As MSF grows, Mother Base will grow along with it."
msgstr "母基地是支持MSF（无国界军队）行动的海上工厂。它提供从士兵宿舍到武器道具研发设施、车辆存放库等一切。随着MSF壮大，母基地也会一同发展。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x641cf8
#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0x2a6fef
msgid "Develop Metal Gear ZEKE."
msgstr "开发合金装备·ZEKE。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x661129
msgid "Save play data to a Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM>."
msgstr "将游戏数据保存到存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x66e48f
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x28a139
msgid "Assigning Staff"
msgstr "分配士兵"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x6a6c8c
msgid "View Mother Base and Player data."
msgstr "查看母基地和玩家数据。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x6c9043
msgid "Search for and access a wireless LAN access point to recruit new staff."
msgstr "搜索并连接无线局域网接入点，以招募新员工。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x6cdfc6
#: slot/0x0006c8de/0xc8d6fc/0xc0c63e
msgid "Embark on a mission."
msgstr "执行任务。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x78277a
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x292139
msgid "Developing Weapons and Items"
msgstr "开发武器与道具"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x7a6779
msgid "Warning: quitting without saving will cause current play data to be lost."
msgstr "警告：未保存即退出将导致当前游戏数据丢失。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x7f620f
msgid "View the log."
msgstr "看日志"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x8122fa
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x28a13b
msgid "The Medical Team and the Sickbay"
msgstr "医疗班与医务室"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x87803a
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x28a13c
msgid "The Intel Team"
msgstr "情报班"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x8919f3
msgid "Play a match versus other players."
msgstr "与其他玩家对战。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x926667
msgid "Sick or injured soldiers will automatically be transported to the Sickbay."
msgstr "患病或受伤的士兵会自动被送往医务室。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x926668
msgid "Soldiers in either state will perform below their natural abilities."
msgstr "这两种状态下，士兵能力发挥低于正常。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x926669
msgid "Their sicknesses or injuries will heal while they are in the Sickbay."
msgstr "他们在医务室期间，疾病或伤势会逐渐痊愈。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x92666a
msgid "The higher the level of your Medical Team, the lower the chances of sicknesses breaking out."
msgstr "医疗班等级越高，疾病爆发的几率越低。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x92666b
msgid "Furthermore, the speed at which soldiers sent to the Sickbay recover will increase."
msgstr "此外，送往医务室的士兵恢复速度也会加快。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x92666c
msgid "Finally, a high-level Medical Team will enable you to develop high-rank tranquilizer guns as well."
msgstr "最后，高等级的医疗班还能让你开发高阶麻醉枪。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x95e980
msgid "Research and develop weapons and items."
msgstr "研究并开发武器与道具。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x99bdf5
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x2aa139
msgid "Developing Metal Gear ZEKE"
msgstr "开发合金装备·ZEKE"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x99df7f
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x29a139
msgid "Dispatching Soldiers"
msgstr "派遣士兵"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x9b6655
msgid "At Mother Base you can develop new weapons and items for use in missions."
msgstr "在母基地，你可以开发用于任务的新武器与道具。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x9b6656
msgid "This icon shows that you are able to start developing weapons and items."
msgstr "此图标表示你可以开始开发武器与道具。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x9b6657
msgid "However, to do so, you will need the amount of GMP (funds) displayed."
msgstr "不过，开发需要消耗所示的GMP（资金）。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x9b6658
msgid "Be careful: if you run out of GMP, development may come to a halt."
msgstr "注意：若GMP耗尽，开发可能会中断。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0x9b6659
msgid "More powerful weapons and items will make difficult missions that much easier."
msgstr "更强的武器与道具，能让困难的任务轻松许多。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xa08aca
msgid "View / change button controls."
msgstr "查看/更改按键操作。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xa30b12
#: slot/0x001df209/0xe6e4ed/0xca66e3
#: slot/0x0024c900/0x6c8948/0x0d743a
#: slot/0x005a5b84/0x9c12db/0x14bb57
#: slot/0x005a5b84/0x9c12db/0x5f9088
#: slot/0x0068bf67/0x7c7faa/0xca66e3
#: slot/0x0081e50b/0x6420cf/0xdd4e99
#: slot/0x0097f0b2/0x80a608/0x6387fd
#: slot/0x0097f0b2/0x80a608/0xeb87f9
#: slot/0x00d9af4c/0x1bed50/0x000a2b
msgid "OK"
msgstr "确定"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xaf3b0a
#: slot/0x00a60c2a/0xe5eb98/0x2a2139
msgid "Sending and Receiving Boxes"
msgstr "收发纸箱"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xb744ce
msgid "View Mother Base status."
msgstr "查看母基地状态。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc04756
msgid "Send a Combat Unit to a conflict zone in need."
msgstr "派遣战斗班前往冲突地区。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc286c3
msgid "DELIVERY allows you to send certain weapons and recovery items to"
msgstr "配送可将特定武器和回收道具通过纸箱发送给"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc286c4
msgid "CO-OPS and VS players via cardboard box."
msgstr "合作任务和对战中的玩家。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc286c5
msgid "After boxes are created, they are registered in the OUT BOX and sent at the end of a CO-OPS or VS session."
msgstr "纸箱制作完成后会登记到寄出箱，在合作任务或对战结束时发送。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc286c6
msgid "Sharing weapons and items with comrades is a smart way to tackle tougher missions."
msgstr "与同伴分享武器和道具是攻克难关的明智之举。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc286c7
msgid "Selecting \"- FREE -\" as the recepient will send the box to an undisclosed recipient via your connections with other players in CO-OPS or VS missions."
msgstr "收件人选择\"- 自由 -\"时，纸箱会通过你在合作任务或对战中与其他玩家的关系发送给未知收件人。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc286c8
msgid "When you receive a box from someone you don't know, you can return the favor by finding the box's original sender under the FRIEND'S FRIENDS tab."
msgstr "收到陌生人的纸箱时，可在好友的好友标签中找到原始寄件人并回礼。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc84e41
msgid "This concludes the tutorial."
msgstr "教程到此结束。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc85c98
msgid "In METAL GEAR, you can develop Metal Gear ZEKE, a bipedal tank."
msgstr "合金装备里能开发双足坦克合金装备·ZEKE。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc85c99
msgid "Once Metal Gear ZEKE is complete, you can deploy this powerful new weapon on OUTER OPS and other missions."
msgstr "合金装备·ZEKE完成后，你就能在外线任务等任务中投入这件强大的新武器。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc85c9a
msgid "Development of Metal Gear ZEKE is dependent on parts collected from all the AI weapons you encounter."
msgstr "开发合金装备·ZEKE需要从你遇到的所有AI武器上收集零件。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xc85c9b
msgid "The parts you can obtain include armaments such as jet packs and additional armor. These parts vary by AI."
msgstr "可获得的零件包括喷气背包和追加装甲等装备。零件因AI而异。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xcb5192
msgid "View staff roster and form teams."
msgstr "查看士兵名册并组队。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xcce522
msgid ""
"To trade staff, start by placing the staff\n"
"you want to trade in the [Trade Waiting\n"
"Room]."
msgstr ""
"要交易员工，请先将\n"
"你想交易的员工放入[交易等候\n"
"室]。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xd61e51
#: slot/0x00726933/0xdb8c41/0x0858ef
#: slot/0x00726933/0xdb8c41/0x8fb17a
msgid "Return to the title menu."
msgstr "返回标题菜单。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xda5151
#: slot/0x0024c900/0x6c8948/0x8715d3
msgid "Trade staff with other players."
msgstr "与其他玩家交换士兵。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xf00757
msgid "You will need to supply sufficient provisions according to the size of your Mother Base staff. Your current food supply is represented by FOOD in the upper-right of the screen."
msgstr "需按母基地人员规模供应足量粮食。当前粮食储备显示在画面右上角的FOOD处。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xf00758
#, c-format
msgid "When FOOD is greater than 100%, soldier morale will rise, enabling soldiers to perform beyond their natural abilities."
msgstr "FOOD高于100%时，士兵士气上升，能发挥出超常能力。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xf00759
#, c-format
msgid "On the other hand, if FOOD is below 100%, morale will fall."
msgstr "反之，FOOD低于100%时，士气会下降。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xf0075a
msgid "If morale falls too low, soldiers will defect and ultimately leave Mother Base."
msgstr "士气过低时，士兵会逃亡，最终离开母基地。"

#: slot/0x0006c8de/0x20dacf/0xf0075b
